{{Checklist|*Speak to [[Captain Tock]] just south of the entrance to [[Falador farm]]. {{Chat option|2What kind of help do you need?|1Sure, I'll try to help with your curse.}}
*Speak to [[Captain Tock]] on the single dock just west of [[Rimmington]]. {{Chat option|1Okay, I'm ready to go to Corsair Cove.}}
*Upon arrival to Corsair, make sure to speak with [[Ithoi the Navigator]] first or else the other npc chats will not work correctly. Find Ithoi by travelling west along the beach. Climb the stairs of the southernmost building on the beach. {{Chat option|1I hear you've been cursed.}}}}
[[File:The Corsair Curse - possessed doll location.png|thumb|375px|Dig here to find the Demonic Doll.]]

===Arsen's, Colin's and Gnocci's "curse"===
{{Checklist|
*Speak to [[Arsen the Thief]] (upstairs in the first house west off the docks). {{Chat option|1I hear you've been cursed.}}
*Speak to [[Cabin Boy Colin]] (in the same room as Arsen, just east). {{Chat option|1I hear you've been cursed.}}
*Speak to [[Gnocci the Cook]] (upstairs in the building just north-west). {{Chat option|1I hear you've been cursed.}}
**Grab the tinderbox next to him if you don't have one.
**Grab the spade found directly south of his hut (right by the tree near the water) if you don't have one.
*Speak to Captain Tock back on the boat (cross south gangplank) to receive the [[Ogre artefact (The Corsair Curse)|ogre artefact]]. {{Chat option|1Arsen says he gave you a sacred ogre relic.}}
*Speak to [[Chief Tess]] in the [[Corsair Cove Dungeon]] (dungeon entrance is just west, in the middle of four small pillars) . {{Chat option|1I've come to return what Arsen stole.}}
*Use a Spade to dig the lump of sand next to the tree where Gnocci the Cook fished in the cutscene. (see image) {{Chat option|1}}
**Three steps east of the tropical tree found west of the fishing spot.
*Use the telescope on the deck of [[Ithoi the Navigator]]'s hut.
*Return to [[Gnocci the Cook]] and speak to him.
*Speak to [[Arsen the Thief]].
*Speak to [[Cabin Boy Colin]].
}}

===Traitor in the midst===
{{Checklist|
*Speak to Captain Tock. {{Chat option|1I've ruled out all the Corsairs' theories...|1So what do I do now?}}
*Speak to Gnocci the Cook. {{Chat option|1I hear it happened straight after dinner.}}
*Speak to [[Arsen the Thief]]. {{Chat option|1I hear Ithoi cooked the meal you ate that night.|1What is the mission Francois is doing?}}
*Speak to Cabin Boy Colin. {{Chat option|1I hear the Captain's thinking of firing Ithoi.}}
*Speak to [[Ithoi the Navigator]]. {{Chat option|1I hear you cooked the meal they ate before getting sick.|1Maybe because the Captain's thinking of firing you.}}
*Speak to Ithoi the Navigator again. {{Chat option|1I know you've faked the curse.|1I bet I can prove you're well enough to get up.}}
*Use your [[tinderbox]] on the driftwood under his hut.
*Speak to Ithoi the Navigator again. {{Chat option|1I saw you running around! You're not sick!}}
*Speak to Captain Tock. {{Chat option|1I've seen Ithoi running around. He's not sick at all.|3I'll be back.}}
{{Instance}}
*Head west again and kill Ithoi the Navigator (level 35).
**Use [[protect from magic]] to take no damage.
*Speak to Captain Tock. {{Chat option|1I've killed Ithoi for poisoning your crew.}}}}

'''Congratulations, quest complete!'''

